        <item>
            <title>0.8.4</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 04:36:42 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.8.4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.8.4</h2>
<ul>
<li>Faster everywhere: eliminated multi-frame freezes when hovering a disk-image file pill, snapping windows, and on the App Launcher&#x27;s first swap</li>
<li>The menu now opens fully on screen when triggered near edges and corners</li>
<li>The Window menu now works on small windows in screen corners</li>
<li>One action, one sound: doubled-up sound effects removed; opening and closing a folder now share the hover sound</li>
<li>Alternative (⌥) pills: the confirmation and toast now always show the face you actually fired</li>
<li>Bigger pill previews in Settings lists</li>
<li>⌘, opens Pierouette&#x27;s settings while a menu is open</li>
<li>Fix: changing a shortcut&#x27;s action type clears the old hotkey so both can&#x27;t fire</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
